    "测试整个目录中的服务器，不受折叠影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test every server in the catalog, including collapsed groups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试整个目录中的服务器，不受折叠影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "测试收藏节点及其全部后代服务器，重复项只测试一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test favorites and all their descendant servers, once per server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试收藏节点及其全部后代服务器，重复项只测试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "目录为空，请到服务器页添加配置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The catalog is empty. Add configurations on the Servers page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录为空，请到服务器页添加配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无收藏，请到服务器页收藏配置或分组。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No favorites. Favorite configurations or groups on the Servers page."
